- Update to 26.07.80
  * New feature release
- Changes since 26.04.3:
  * Add qt6-next build
  * Clean up root module
  * Add smoke test
  * pagestack: Fix pushed items getting auto-deleted
  * Fix headers not being added to pages
  * Show desktop entry only in KDE
  * Fix crash when exiting in kcm
  * Fix potential undefined behavior in menu list obtaining
  * Update readme
  * Filter out KCMs without form factor settings when not on desktop
  * Filter out kcms for other Qt platforms and self-reported relevancy

